explotarory testing/
exploratory_testing/
qa/logs/
qa/*.log
SDK_BACKEND_PARITY_MATRIX.md

# Public-repo hygiene — internal staging credentials + wire-dump metadata.
# Files were committed when the QA harness lived in this repo with a
# hardcoded internal-staging user (admin login + password) plus wire-dump
# JSONs that include actor_label. None of these are safe to publish
# externally. They remain on disk for internal use; this block prevents
# (re)tracking them.

# Wire-dump JSON — internal debug captures containing actor metadata
examples/_tc*_wire_dump.json

# Files with hardcoded internal-staging admin login (see qa/setup_helpers.py
